{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "221205f5c50c59f5dd6550d8e0637e363b03a4cb819afd1f1798fb122bc1e321", "ja": "（学校の校舎を借り切っての『アイグラ！！』の撮影。\nそろそろ、春香の出番だけど……）", "zh": "（包下整栋学校校舍进行《偶像格斗！！》的拍摄。差不多该轮到春香出场了，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "1cc83a18fe24539c96bcee1eb3feeaeb0c64aa2cf95cc0c553d275647403b8a5", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1e066abe6a7579d716e8e47b4ca235c7a7045b20f820e2cb0fda67f822726950", "ja": "春香、ここにいたんだな。\n見つかってよかった。", "zh": "春香，你在这里啊。\n找到你就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "4e59b00705bf63530f8e526889541af2535281bad872c328598f085401f0046e", "ja": "え……あれっ、もう撮影の時間ですか！？\nす、すみません。あちこち見てたら、つい……。", "zh": "诶……咦，已经到拍摄时间了吗！？\n对、对不起。我东看看西看看的，不知不觉就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1004_p", "source_sha256": "639250df631663b2394b3b2d3961f709f8ababcebdf68511728089d1363ef65b", "ja": "いや、今すぐ撮るってわけじゃないけど、\n心の準備だけは頼むよ。", "zh": "不，倒也不是马上就要开拍，\n不过做好心理准备就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "b352d1142585611a250dd6de4103d8783877707cfd9eef3b98d8b011e535e54b", "ja": "はい、そうですよね。\nお仕事……うん、これはお仕事、お仕事～。", "zh": "是的，确实是这样。\n工作……嗯，这是工作，工作～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1006_p", "source_sha256": "dc80d9bafd30ade608fb3d326c2ba293c2f6dc674a892906fc7246e4a7508ebd", "ja": "あれ、どうしたんだ？\n珍しく、あんまり集中できてないみたいだけど。", "zh": "怎么了？\n真少见，你好像不太能集中注意力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "4911435acad83cb4e48c7243d8125adda7f4338a3afbbbd695cd141a08814ca8", "ja": "うう、ごめんなさい。なんだか、知らない学校の\n中っていうのがすごく新鮮で、ドキドキしちゃって。", "zh": "呜呜，对不起。总觉得在陌生的学校里\n感觉特别新鲜，让人忍不住心跳加速。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "0f53f546c8976c1b03766b4bf71d9307b37a74c29b974e06e976e9350c011488", "ja": "この廊下の角を曲がると……あ、視聴覚室発見！\nみたいなのが楽しくて、探険気分というか……。", "zh": "转过这条走廊的拐角……啊，发现视听教室！像这样特别有意思，就像是在探险一样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1009_p", "source_sha256": "50ae12b39f440c8b38b969f9c5c3ca8811e37b3a0271ac2c70571ccf5d208dda", "ja": "はは、なるほど。\n新入生みたいな気持ちになってるのかもな。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。\n你可能是有点像新生一样的心情吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "160cf3fdef1b76dd6fd56450376288f1a4f52bd95902c900537f4b3636740ab7", "ja": "あ、きっとそうです！　この学校に通い始めたら、\nどんな毎日になるのかな～、なんて想像しちゃって。", "zh": "啊，一定是这样！要是开始来这所学校上学，每天会过得怎么样呢～不知不觉就想象起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "34ce3a13521dfa7c44fb090b1917913bf04662429cb77ebc0dbaaab052f4ea61", "ja": "でもダメですよね、お仕事で来てるんだし。\nう～、お仕事、お仕事～。", "zh": "不过这样不行吧，毕竟是来工作的嘛。\n呜～工作，工作～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9d973121e987f56b328af43264b1f892627a9077e0c39c52ab588c56e2030f5a", "ja": "いや、そういうことなら……今のまま、\n心の準備はしない方がいい気がする。", "zh": "不，既然这样的话……我倒觉得\n保持现在的状态，先不要做心理准备比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "9dfb05aa95d4418540826b9bf559204962be3acab2e860b860a5ba98dc7275eb", "ja": "ええっ？　でもあの、これって……\nお仕事ですよね？", "zh": "诶？可是那个，这个是……工作吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0f2c84980280044dab5dd858a4dd6d6205f0db8dd19690e4c09bbb567f658baa", "ja": "もちろん。ただ、新しい学校生活を前に、\n期待に胸を膨らませる、新入生みたいな気分。", "zh": "当然了。只是觉得，面对即将开始的新学校生活、\n满心期待的新生般的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2c997ad12c27ec435afd59c24a303f82118f88bd306220285a514b36b2c1fee9", "ja": "そんな今の春香の方が、最高にフレッシュな、\n高校生らしい写真を撮ってもらえそうだと思って。", "zh": "所以我觉得，像现在这样的春香，反而更能拍出特别清新、很有高中生感觉的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "836812bfd42907507136c572fba05cdb79a02815c4f075ff3a0afd8d30e21b75", "ja": "あ、そっか……！　えへへ、わかりました。\nそれじゃ遠慮なく、新入生気分のままで……。", "zh": "啊，这样啊……！嘿嘿，我明白了。\n那我就不客气了，继续保持新生的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "9fa2e3650dbdc7ffaa8fdc64810a4fef64747fbf35ef0eedbab135fa14ad4cf6", "ja": "先生、おはようございます！\n今日も一日、よろしくお願いしますね！　なーんて♪", "zh": "老师，早上好！\n今天也请多多关照啦！开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0143_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d8c2a0f5c231497ea761f5f6c2623a3f57d8bd083855c9294c499b651d91d309", "ja": "（どこか初々しい、朗らかな笑顔。こんな挨拶から\n始まる授業なら、先生も頑張りたくなりそうだ！）", "zh": "（带着几分青涩的爽朗笑容。要是从这样的问候开始上课，连老师似乎都会想努力起来！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
